Atiga GMS
=========

Getting started
---------------

To use this gms, you need clone it:
```
git clone -b android-15 --single-branch --depth=1 https://github.com/Atiga-Stuff/vendor_gms.git vendor/gms
```

Sincs this repo use git LFS, then you need run it in directory you've been clone it:
```
git lfs pull
```

Then you need include it:
```
$(call inherit-product-if-exists, vendor/gms/products/gms.mk)
```
